    "layout": "support",
    "html": "<article class=\"app-card\" data-application-component=\"article\"><h2>Invite a teammate</h2><p class=\"article-byline\">Jordan Lee \u00b7 Updated November 2</p><p>Add people to your workspace and choose their access.</p><ol class=\"article-steps\"><li><h3>Open Members</h3><p>Choose Members from workspace settings.</p></li><li><h3>Send an invitation</h3><p>Enter the email address and select a role.</p></li></ol><a href=\"dashboards/account.html?view=members\">Open member settings</a></article>"
